[indent]•  司马懿及司马氏全面控制曹魏朝政[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  为[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "淮南三叛", "cat": "events"}]淮南三叛[/url][/color]（王凌、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "毌丘俭", "cat": "people"}]毌丘俭[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "诸葛诞", "cat": "people"}]诸葛诞[/url][/color]之乱）提供背景——三叛均以"讨伐权臣"为旗号[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  为[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "司马炎代魏建晋", "cat": "events"}]司马炎代魏建晋[/url][/color]奠定基础[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


